>28×22\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">50–80 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card\">\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">XL</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">39×28\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">80+ lbs</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cnacc__size-section\">\n        <p class=\"cnacc__size-heading\">Leaf Mat (S · M · L only)</p>\n        <div class=\"cnacc__size-grid-3\">\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card\">\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">S</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">34×39\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">Up to 15 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card\">\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">M</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">48×51\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">15–40 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card pop\">\n            <span class=\"pop-tag\">Popular</span>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">L</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">51×59\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">40–80 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cnacc__size-section\">\n        <p class=\"cnacc__size-heading\">Shell Mat (S · M · L only)</p>\n        <div class=\"cnacc__size-grid-3\">\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card\">\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">S</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">36×34\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">Up to 15 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card\">\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">M</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">48×45\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">15–40 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"cnacc__size-card pop\">\n            <span class=\"pop-tag\">Popular</span>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-letter\">L</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-dims\">55×51\"</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__size-weight\">40–80 lbs</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"cnacc__size-note\">Note: XL is not available for Leaf & Shell shapes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cnacc__size-tip\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"8.5\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/>\n        </svg>\n        Between sizes? Size <strong>&nbsp;up&nbsp;</strong> for extra comfort.\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ④ SHIPPING + RETURNS -->\n  <div class=\"cnacc__item\" data-cnacc>\n    <button class=\"cnacc__trigger\" type=\"button\">\n      <div class=\"cnacc__badge cnacc__badge--orange\">\n        <svg stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n          <rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"cnacc__label\">Shipping + Returns</span>\n      <svg class=\"cnacc__chev\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n        <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"cnacc__body\">\n      <div class=\"cnacc__ship-grid\">\n        <div class=\"cnacc__ship-card\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n            <rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/>\n            <polygon points=\"16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-title\">Free Shipping</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-sub\">On every U.S. order</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cnacc__ship-card\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n            <polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-title\">Ships in 2–4 Days</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-sub\">Fast warehouse processing</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cnacc__ship-card\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n            <rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" rx=\"1\"/>\n            <polygon points=\"16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n            <circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"18.5\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-title\">3–5 Day Delivery</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-sub\">Full tracking included</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cnacc__ship-card\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n            <polyline points=\"23 4 23 10 17 10\"/>\n            <path d=\"M20.49 15a9 9 0 1 1-2.12-9.36L23 10\"/>\n          </svg>\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-title\">30-Day Returns</div>\n            <div class=\"cnacc__ship-sub\">Hassle-free exchange</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var items = document.querySelectorAll('[data-cnacc]');\n  items.forEach(function(item){\n    var btn = item.querySelector('.cnacc__trigger');\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n      var isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');\n      items.forEach(function(i){ i.classList.remove('open'); });\n      if(!isOpen) item.classList.add('open');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>"
